I would say to remove Mitch McConnell in 2020
as it would be to remove Donald Trump in 2020

00:00:29.789 --> 00:00:34.660
but as I told you yesterday, without rehashing
the entire story, Kentucky is very red.

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:39.630
There are real obstacles for Amy McGrath who's
a former marine fighter pilot, but there's

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:44.270
at least some good news early that gives us
some sense of hope and at least the idea that

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:48.910
this is a race that is worth investing time
and money into a Amy McGrath has raised more

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:53.030
